<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n66596" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μεταβολ-ικός</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ή</span>,
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">όν</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>changeable</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τρόπος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plb.
					38.5.6
				</span></i>
			; of persons, Vett. Val.<i><span class="en">
				14.16
			</span></i>; <i>subject to change, mutable</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μέρη</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					2.373d
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φύσις</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Simp.
					<u>in Cael.</u>
					114.14
				</span></i>
			. Adv. -<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κῶς</span>
			<i>with a change</i> of metre, <i><span class="en">
				Heph.
			</span></i><i>Poëm.</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				p.74
			</span></i> C. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">καπηλεῖον μ.</span>
			<i>retail</i> shop (cf. 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μεταβόλος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					11
				</span></i>
			), <i><span class="en">
				Heraclid.
				<u>Pol.</u>
				60
			</span></i> (-<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μελικόν</span> codd.).
			</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φωνήεντα μ.</span>
			<i>doubtful</i> vowels (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">α ι υ</span>), <i><span class="en">
				S.E.
				<u>M.</u>
				1.100
			</span></i>.</div>
